ipting.ValueConnection"},{"position":{"xMin":-40.0,"yMin":-60.0,"xMax":2360.0,"yMax":500.0},"label":"1. A trader made out","comment":"On ship made out -> if a meeting can be offered now (no other on, at sea, no panel open) -> her facts and the choice. With no answer in 60 seconds, you hold your course.","color":{"r":0.62,"g":0.45,"b":0.22,"a":1.0},"guid":"b33690a8-0a55-4a4e-bdb7-b927151084f9","$version":"A","$type":"Unity.VisualScripting.GraphGroup"},{"position":{"xMin":2380.0,"yMin":-60.0,"xMax":3580.0,"yMax":500.0},"label":"2. Closing with her","comment":"She heaves to; your ship makes for her, rowing the last of it (VoyagePlanner). Alongside (40 game metres) the clock holds and the talk begins. If the meeting ends first, it''s let go.","color":{"r":0.25,"g":0.42,"b":0.62,"a":1.0},"guid":"d4a295dd-89f6-47ba-a9a7-e6400ebf9ae1","$version":"A","$type":"Unity.VisualScripting.GraphGroup"},{"position":{"xMin":-40.0,"yMin":600.0,"xMax":2660.0,"yMax":1220.0},"label":"3. Alongside: the talk","comment":"The menu (the ''Hail menu'' event): ask after the weather she met (the weather model along her track, every 6 hours back to 48), ask what prices she knows (into your ledger, as heard from her, where newer than yours), or ask what she''d sell (a little of her biggest lot, at her destination''s price less 15%), or part ways. What she told shows on the menu.","color":{"r":0.62,"g":0.45,"b":0.22,"a":1.0},"guid":"7e95f751-46e4-4067-9434-8b5feb4affa7","$version":"A","$type":"Unity.VisualScripting.GraphGroup"},{"position":{"xMin":2180.0,"yMin":660.0,"xMax":2620.0,"yMax":960.0},"title":"Adding to the talk","body":"Add an option in the row (Text: Add option, a key and its intention), add its number to the Switch''s options, and wire what it does from the Switch''s new exit, then ''Hail menu'' again. To come: news of raids and fairs she''s heard.","colorTheme":"Classic","guid":"57aee2a1-777b-458c-b1bc-10c7cf2dd367","$type":"Unity.VisualScripting.StickyNote"}],"$version":"A"}}'
